Subject: [PATCH] lane-301: protected-win vulkan-cm1-fa-sparse-gather-hoist for
 lever 1 (20f86b8cc7)

Registers the sparse cm1 FA gather-column hoist + K slice double buffer with its op gate, planted RED, served ABBA vs v0.1.3.1 (80cb4288de code) and RGA ISA receipts. arifi_sync protected-win validate --draft: PASS, 64 entries.

Origin: lane-301
Measured-effect: none (registration only; the measured effect is 20f86b8cc7's, cache/qsa-x1-lane/cells/c31-10091916-state.json)
Lane: lane-301
