+      "workload": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GSQ-RCO IQ3_S (ISTA-DASLab), llama-server -ub 4096 -b 4096 -c 33792 -fa on -lm dio -np 1 --lazy-mode on, F16 KV, Radeon 890M Vulkan (Minisforum AI X1 Pro-470); prompts 2K/8K/16K/32K, n_predict 128; ABBA x2 bin-fx (d579bb51f6, tree = 20f86b8cc7) vs v0.1.3.1 comparator bin-point (ed590650bd engine code), 32K arms in their own batch (c31-10091916).",
